  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "いつでも　ポケモンセンターの\nパソコンの　ボックスに　アクセスして\nポケモンを　あずけたり　ひきだせる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "언제든지 포켓몬센터에 있는\nPC의 박스에 접속해서\n포켓몬을 맡기거나 데려올 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能隨時連線到\n寶可夢中心電腦裡的盒子，\n寄放或領出寶可夢。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permet d’accéder aux Boîtes PC du Centre Pokémon\nà tout moment pour y déposer ou en retirer\ndes Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ermöglicht jederzeit Zugriff auf die PC-Boxen im\nPokémon-Center, um Pokémon abzulegen oder\nins Team aufzunehmen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permite acceder en todo momento a tus Cajas del PC\nde los Centros Pokémon para dejar o sacar Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permette di accedere in qualsiasi momento ai Box\ndel PC del Centro Pokémon per depositare o ritirare\ni Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A device that allows you to access the Pokémon storage\nsystem. There are some places where it won’t work.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "いつでも　ポケモンセンターの\nパソコンの　ボックスに　アクセスして\nポケモンを　預けたり　引きだせる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可以随时访问\n宝可梦中心电脑里的盒子，\n来寄放或领回需要的宝可梦。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permite acceder en todo momento a tus Cajas del PC\nde los Centros Pokémon para dejar o sacar Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
